before:
Complete local C++ example; the app itself does not execute it:
```cpp
#include <iostream>
constexpr int twice(int value) { return value * 2; }
int main() {
    constexpr int size = twice(3);
    static_assert(size == 6, "unexpected size");
    std::cout << size << "\n";
}
```

